# Environment for running the service inside the aisc platform (compose merge).
# Compose itself sets every value the service needs: the root path, the model
# (BAF_LLM_* from CONTROL_OBJECTIVES_LLM_*), the database URLs and the service
# URLs; the port stays at its default, 8090. What is left here are examples.
# For standalone dev, set these in your shell or a local .env (see .env.example).

# For a hosted provider instead of the local model, set these in the stack's env
# file (compose passes them on as BAF_LLM_PROVIDER and BAF_LLM_MODEL), with the
# provider's key; never commit a key here.
# CONTROL_OBJECTIVES_LLM_PROVIDER=mistral
# CONTROL_OBJECTIVES_LLM_MODEL=mistral-large-latest
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# Serve a different control-objectives export instead of the bundled CSV.
# CONTROL_OBJECTIVES_FILE=/path/to/ai_act_control_objectives.csv
